    "text": "By Ava Danklefsen ,\n1 days ago Many students visit the library at Northport High School at least once a day for a multitude of different reasons. Whether it’s to study, do homework, take out a book, or hang out with your friends during your lunch period, the library is always crowded with people- a little too crowded. A lot of students and even teachers complain about there not being enough furniture in the library. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
